{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "f",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "2",
        "lineBreak": "1",
        "lineSpacing": "4pt",
        "text": "${@i18n.su_foot}",
        "fontSize": "10.5pt",
        "textColor": "#9AA0A6|#8E939B"
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "su_foot": "数据来源：Open-Meteo（开放气象数据，无需密钥）。城市与坐标默认只保存在本机。城市检索结果含 OpenStreetMap 数据（© OSM 贡献者）。"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "su_foot": "Source: Open-Meteo (open weather data, no API key). Your city and its coordinates stay on your devices. City search results include data from OpenStreetMap (© OSM contributors)."
      }
    }
  },
  "_note": "来源与隐私(§7.1.1 第 5 条:用户是靠这段话决定要不要交出这一步的)。与正常首页的 p-foot 说的是同一件事,措辞按这一屏的语境重写:那边讲刷新节奏,这边讲城市存在哪。\n⚠️ 页脚那句 OSM 归属是 Nominatim 使用政策的**硬要求**(clearly display attribution),不是客气话 —— 城市检索在 open-meteo 交白卷时会补一次 OSM(见 geo.df 第三路)。"
}